{"1":{"w":[{"c":"حمٓ","d":"Ha-meem","e":"Ha Meem"}],"a":{"g":"Ha, Meem."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"تَنْزِيلٌ","d":"tanzīlun","e":"A revelation"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنِ","d":"l-raḥmāni","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"الرَّحِيمِ","d":"l-raḥīmi","e":"the Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"[This is] a revelation from the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful -"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"كِتَابٌ","d":"kitābun","e":"A Book"},{"c":"فُصِّلَتْ","d":"fuṣṣilat","e":"are detailed"},{"c":"ءَايَاتُهُ","d":"āyātuhu","e":"its Verses"},{"c":"قُرْءَانًا","d":"qur'ānan","e":"a Quran"},{"c":"عَرَبِيًّا","d":"ʿarabiyyan","e":"(in) Arabic"},{"c":"لِقَوْمٍ","d":"liqawmin","e":"for a people"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"who know"}],"a":{"g":"A Book whose verses have been detailed, an Arabic Qur'an for a people who know,"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"بَشِيرًا","d":"bashīran","e":"A giver of glad tidings"},{"c":"وَنَذِيرًا","d":"wanadhīran","e":"and a warner"},{"c":"فَأَعْرَضَ","d":"fa-aʿraḍa","e":"but turn away"},{"c":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","d":"aktharuhum","e":"most of them"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَسْمَعُونَ","d":"yasmaʿūna","e":"hear"}],"a":{"g":"As a giver of good tidings and a warner; but most of them turn away, so they do not hear."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they say"},{"c":"قُلُوبُنَا","d":"qulūbunā","e":"Our hearts"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"أَكِنَّةٍ","d":"akinnatin","e":"coverings"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"from what"},{"c":"تَدْعُونَا","d":"tadʿūnā","e":"you call us"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to it"},{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"and in"},{"c":"ءَاذَانِنَا","d":"ādhāninā","e":"our ears"},{"c":"وَقْرٌ","d":"waqrun","e":"(is) deafness"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"and between us"},{"c":"بَيْنِنَا","d":"bayninā","e":"and between us"},{"c":"وَبَيْنِكَ","d":"wabaynika","e":"and between you"},{"c":"حِجَابٌ","d":"ḥijābun","e":"(is) a screen"},{"c":"فَاعْمَلْ","d":"fa-iʿ'mal","e":"So work"},{"c":"إِنَّنَا","d":"innanā","e":"indeed, we"},{"c":"عَامِلُونَ","d":"ʿāmilūna","e":"(are) working"}],"a":{"g":"And they say, \"Our hearts are within coverings from that to which you invite us, and in our ears is deafness, and between us and you is a partition, so work; indeed, we are working.\""}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"أَنَا","d":"anā","e":"I am"},{"c":"بَشَرٌ","d":"basharun","e":"a man"},{"c":"مِثْلُكُمْ","d":"mith'lukum","e":"like you"},{"c":"يُوحَى","d":"yūḥā","e":"it is revealed"},{"c":"إِلَيَّ","d":"ilayya","e":"to me"},{"c":"أَنَّمَا","d":"annamā","e":"that"},{"c":"إِلَهُكُمْ","d":"ilāhukum","e":"your god"},{"c":"إِلَهٌ","d":"ilāhun","e":"(is) God"},{"c":"وَاحِدٌ","d":"wāḥidun","e":"One"},{"c":"فَاسْتَقِيمُوا","d":"fa-is'taqīmū","e":"so take a Straight Path"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to Him"},{"c":"وَاسْتَغْفِرُوهُ","d":"wa-is'taghfirūhu","e":"and ask His forgiveness"},{"c":"وَوَيْلٌ","d":"wawaylun","e":"And woe"},{"c":"لِلْمُشْرِكِينَ","d":"lil'mush'rikīna","e":"to the polytheists"}],"a":{"g":"Say, O [Muhammad], \"I am only a man like you to whom it has been revealed that your god is but one God; so take a straight course to Him and seek His forgiveness.\" And woe to those who associate others with Allah -"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"Those who"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يُؤْتُونَ","d":"yu'tūna","e":"give"},{"c":"الزَّكَوةَ","d":"l-zakata","e":"the zakah"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"and they"},{"c":"بِالْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"bil-ākhirati","e":"in the Hereafter"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"كَافِرُونَ","d":"kāfirūna","e":"(are) disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"Those who do not give zakah, and in the Hereafter they are disbelievers."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"وَعَمِلُوا","d":"waʿamilū","e":"and do"},{"c":"الصَّالِحَاتِ","d":"l-ṣāliḥāti","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"أَجْرٌ","d":"ajrun","e":"(is) a reward"},{"c":"غَيْرُ","d":"ghayru","e":"never ending"},{"c":"مَمْنُونٍ","d":"mamnūnin","e":"never ending"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who believe and do righteous deeds - for them is a reward uninterrupted."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أَئِنَّكُمْ","d":"a-innakum","e":"Do you indeed"},{"c":"لَتَكْفُرُونَ","d":"latakfurūna","e":"[surely] disbelieve"},{"c":"بِالَّذِي","d":"bi-alladhī","e":"in the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"created"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"يَوْمَيْنِ","d":"yawmayni","e":"two periods"},{"c":"وَتَجْعَلُونَ","d":"watajʿalūna","e":"and you set up"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"with Him"},{"c":"أَنْدَادًا","d":"andādan","e":"rivals"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"رَبُّ","d":"rabbu","e":"(is the) Lord"},{"c":"الْعَالَمِينَ","d":"l-ʿālamīna","e":"(of) the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Do you indeed disbelieve in He who created the earth in two days and attribute to Him equals? That is the Lord of the worlds.\""}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَعَلَ","d":"wajaʿala","e":"And He placed"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"رَوَاسِيَ","d":"rawāsiya","e":"firmly-set mountains"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"above it"},{"c":"فَوْقِهَا","d":"fawqihā","e":"above it"},{"c":"وَبَارَكَ","d":"wabāraka","e":"and He blessed"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَقَدَّرَ","d":"waqaddara","e":"and determined"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"أَقْوَاتَهَا","d":"aqwātahā","e":"its sustenance"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"أَرْبَعَةِ","d":"arbaʿati","e":"four"},{"c":"أَيَّامٍ","d":"ayyāmin","e":"periods"},{"c":"سَوَاءً","d":"sawāan","e":"equal"},{"c":"لِلسَّائِلِينَ","d":"lilssāilīna","e":"for those who ask"}],"a":{"g":"And He placed on the earth firmly set mountains over its surface, and He blessed it and determined therein its [creatures'] sustenance in four days without distinction - for [the information] of those who ask."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"اسْتَوَى","d":"is'tawā","e":"He directed (Himself)"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"towards"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"وَهِيَ","d":"wahiya","e":"while it (was)"},{"c":"دُخَانٌ","d":"dukhānun","e":"smoke"},{"c":"فَقَالَ","d":"faqāla","e":"and He said"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"to it"},{"c":"وَلِلْأَرْضِ","d":"walil'arḍi","e":"and to the earth"},{"c":"ائْتِيَا","d":"i'tiyā","e":"Come both of you"},{"c":"طَوْعًا","d":"ṭawʿan","e":"willingly"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"كَرْهًا","d":"karhan","e":"unwillingly"},{"c":"قَالَتَا","d":"qālatā","e":"They both said"},{"c":"أَتَيْنَا","d":"ataynā","e":"We come"},{"c":"طَائِعِينَ","d":"ṭāiʿīna","e":"willingly"}],"a":{"g":"Then He directed Himself to the heaven while it was smoke and said to it and to the earth, \"Come [into being], willingly or by compulsion.\" They said, \"We have come willingly.\""}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَضَاهُنَّ","d":"faqaḍāhunna","e":"Then He completed them"},{"c":"سَبْعَ","d":"sabʿa","e":"(as) seven"},{"c":"سَمَاوَاتٍ","d":"samāwātin","e":"heavens"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"يَوْمَيْنِ","d":"yawmayni","e":"two periods"},{"c":"وَأَوْحَى","d":"wa-awḥā","e":"and He revealed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"each"},{"c":"سَمَاءٍ","d":"samāin","e":"heaven"},{"c":"أَمْرَهَا","d":"amrahā","e":"its affair"},{"c":"وَزَيَّنَّا","d":"wazayyannā","e":"And We adorned"},{"c":"السَّمَاءَ","d":"l-samāa","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"the nearest"},{"c":"بِمَصَابِيحَ","d":"bimaṣābīḥa","e":"with lamps"},{"c":"وَحِفْظًا","d":"waḥif'ẓan","e":"and (to) guard"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"تَقْدِيرُ","d":"taqdīru","e":"(is the) Decree"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزِ","d":"l-ʿazīzi","e":"(of) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمِ","d":"l-ʿalīmi","e":"the All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"And He completed them as seven heavens within two days and inspired in each heaven its command. And We adorned the nearest heaven with lamps and as protection. That is the determination of the Exalted in Might, the Knowing."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنْ","d":"fa-in","e":"But if"},{"c":"أَعْرَضُوا","d":"aʿraḍū","e":"they turn away"},{"c":"فَقُلْ","d":"faqul","e":"then say"},{"c":"أَنْذَرْتُكُمْ","d":"andhartukum","e":"I have warned you"},{"c":"صَاعِقَةً","d":"ṣāʿiqatan","e":"(of) a thunderbolt"},{"c":"مِثْلَ","d":"mith'la","e":"like"},{"c":"صَاعِقَةِ","d":"ṣāʿiqati","e":"(the) thunderbolt"},{"c":"عَادٍ","d":"ʿādin","e":"(of) Aad"},{"c":"وَثَمُودَ","d":"wathamūda","e":"and Thamud"}],"a":{"g":"But if they turn away, then say, \"I have warned you of a thunderbolt like the thunderbolt [that struck] 'Aad and Thamud."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"جَاءَتْهُمُ","d":"jāathumu","e":"came to them"},{"c":"الرُّسُلُ","d":"l-rusulu","e":"the Messengers"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from before them"},{"c":"بَيْنِ","d":"bayni","e":"from before them"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"from before them"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"and from"},{"c":"خَلْفِهِمْ","d":"khalfihim","e":"behind them"},{"c":"أَلَّا","d":"allā","e":"(saying) Do not"},{"c":"تَعْبُدُوا","d":"taʿbudū","e":"worship"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"If"},{"c":"شَاءَ","d":"shāa","e":"(had) willed"},{"c":"رَبُّنَا","d":"rabbunā","e":"our Lord"},{"c":"لَأَنْزَلَ","d":"la-anzala","e":"surely, He (would have) sent down"},{"c":"مَلَائِكَةً","d":"malāikatan","e":"Angels"},{"c":"فَإِنَّا","d":"fa-innā","e":"So indeed, we"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"in what"},{"c":"أُرْسِلْتُمْ","d":"ur'sil'tum","e":"you have been sent"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"with"},{"c":"كَافِرُونَ","d":"kāfirūna","e":"(are) disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"[That occurred] when the messengers had come to them before them and after them, [saying], \"Worship not except Allah.\" They said, \"If our Lord had willed, He would have sent down the angels, so indeed we, in that with which you have been sent, are disbelievers.\""}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"Then as for"},{"c":"عَادٌ","d":"ʿādun","e":"Aad"},{"c":"فَاسْتَكْبَرُوا","d":"fa-is'takbarū","e":"they were arrogant"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"بِغَيْرِ","d":"bighayri","e":"without"},{"c":"الْحَقِّ","d":"l-ḥaqi","e":"[the] right"},{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"and they said"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Who"},{"c":"أَشَدُّ","d":"ashaddu","e":"(is) mightier"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"than us"},{"c":"قُوَّةً","d":"quwwatan","e":"(in) strength"},{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they see"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَهُمْ","d":"khalaqahum","e":"created them"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"أَشَدُّ","d":"ashaddu","e":"(is) Mightier"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"than them"},{"c":"قُوَّةً","d":"quwwatan","e":"(in) strength"},{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"But they used (to)"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"in Our Signs"},{"c":"يَجْحَدُونَ","d":"yajḥadūna","e":"deny"}],"a":{"g":"As for 'Aad, they were arrogant upon the earth without right and said, \"Who is greater than us in strength?\" Did they not consider that Allah who created them was greater than them in strength? But they were rejecting Our signs."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَرْسَلْنَا","d":"fa-arsalnā","e":"So We sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"رِيحًا","d":"rīḥan","e":"a wind"},{"c":"صَرْصَرًا","d":"ṣarṣaran","e":"furious"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"أَيَّامٍ","d":"ayyāmin","e":"(the) days"},{"c":"نَحِسَاتٍ","d":"naḥisātin","e":"(of) misfortune"},{"c":"لِنُذِيقَهُمْ","d":"linudhīqahum","e":"that We may make them taste"},{"c":"عَذَابَ","d":"ʿadhāba","e":"(the) punishment"},{"c":"الْخِزْيِ","d":"l-khiz'yi","e":"(of) disgrace"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْحَيَوةِ","d":"l-ḥayati","e":"the life"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"(of) the world"},{"c":"وَلَعَذَابُ","d":"walaʿadhābu","e":"And surely, (the) punishment"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"(of) the Hereafter"},{"c":"أَخْزَى","d":"akhzā","e":"(is) more disgracing"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"and they"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"will not be helped"},{"c":"يُنْصَرُونَ","d":"yunṣarūna","e":"will not be helped"}],"a":{"g":"So We sent upon them a screaming wind during days of misfortune to make them taste the punishment of disgrace in the worldly life; but the punishment of the Hereafter is more disgracing, and they will not be helped."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"And as for"},{"c":"ثَمُودُ","d":"thamūdu","e":"Thamud"},{"c":"فَهَدَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"fahadaynāhum","e":"We guided them"},{"c":"فَاسْتَحَبُّوا","d":"fa-is'taḥabbū","e":"but they preferred"},{"c":"الْعَمَى","d":"l-ʿamā","e":"[the] blindness"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"الْهُدَى","d":"l-hudā","e":"the guidance"},{"c":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمْ","d":"fa-akhadhathum","e":"so seized them"},{"c":"صَاعِقَةُ","d":"ṣāʿiqatu","e":"a thunderbolt"},{"c":"الْعَذَابِ","d":"l-ʿadhābi","e":"(of) the punishment"},{"c":"الْهُونِ","d":"l-hūni","e":"humiliating"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَكْسِبُونَ","d":"yaksibūna","e":"earn"}],"a":{"g":"And as for Thamud, We guided them, but they preferred blindness over guidance, so the thunderbolt of humiliating punishment seized them for what they used to earn."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَجَّيْنَا","d":"wanajjaynā","e":"And We saved"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believed"},{"c":"وَكَانُوا","d":"wakānū","e":"and used (to)"},{"c":"يَتَّقُونَ","d":"yattaqūna","e":"fear (Allah)"}],"a":{"g":"And We saved those who believed and used to fear Allah."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَوْمَ","d":"wayawma","e":"And (the) Day"},{"c":"يُحْشَرُ","d":"yuḥ'sharu","e":"will be gathered"},{"c":"أَعْدَاءُ","d":"aʿdāu","e":"(the) enemies"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"then they"},{"c":"يُوزَعُونَ","d":"yūzaʿūna","e":"will be assembled in rows"}],"a":{"g":"And [mention, O Muhammad], the Day when the enemies of Allah will be gathered to the Fire while they are [driven] assembled in rows,"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"Until"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"when"},{"c":"جَاءُوهَا","d":"jāūhā","e":"they come to it"},{"c":"شَهِدَ","d":"shahida","e":"(will) testify"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"against them"},{"c":"سَمْعُهُمْ","d":"samʿuhum","e":"their hearing"},{"c":"وَأَبْصَارُهُمْ","d":"wa-abṣāruhum","e":"and their sight"},{"c":"وَجُلُودُهُمْ","d":"wajulūduhum","e":"and their skins"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"(as) to what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَعْمَلُونَ","d":"yaʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"Until, when they reach it, their hearing and their eyes and their skins will testify against them of what they used to do."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"And they will say"},{"c":"لِجُلُودِهِمْ","d":"lijulūdihim","e":"to their skins"},{"c":"لِمَ","d":"lima","e":"Why do"},{"c":"شَهِدْتُمْ","d":"shahidttum","e":"you testify"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"against us"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They will say"},{"c":"أَنْطَقَنَا","d":"anṭaqanā","e":"Allah made us speak"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah made us speak"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the One Who"},{"c":"أَنْطَقَ","d":"anṭaqa","e":"makes speak"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"created you"},{"c":"أَوَّلَ","d":"awwala","e":"(the) first"},{"c":"مَرَّةٍ","d":"marratin","e":"time"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْهِ","d":"wa-ilayhi","e":"and to Him"},{"c":"تُرْجَعُونَ","d":"tur'jaʿūna","e":"you will be returned"}],"a":{"g":"And they will say to their skins, \"Why have you testified against us?\" They will say, \"We were made to speak by Allah, who has made everything speak; and He created you the first time, and to Him you are returned."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you were"},{"c":"تَسْتَتِرُونَ","d":"tastatirūna","e":"covering yourselves"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"lest"},{"c":"يَشْهَدَ","d":"yashhada","e":"testify"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"against you"},{"c":"سَمْعُكُمْ","d":"samʿukum","e":"your hearing"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَبْصَارُكُمْ","d":"abṣārukum","e":"your sight"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"جُلُودُكُمْ","d":"julūdukum","e":"your skins"},{"c":"وَلَكِنْ","d":"walākin","e":"but"},{"c":"ظَنَنْتُمْ","d":"ẓanantum","e":"you assumed"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(does) not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُ","d":"yaʿlamu","e":"know"},{"c":"كَثِيرًا","d":"kathīran","e":"much"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"of what"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"you do"}],"a":{"g":"And you were not covering yourselves, lest your hearing testify against you or your sight or your skins, but you assumed that Allah does not know much of what you do."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"وَذَلِكُمْ","d":"wadhālikum","e":"And that"},{"c":"ظَنُّكُمُ","d":"ẓannukumu","e":"(was) your assumption"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"ظَنَنْتُمْ","d":"ẓanantum","e":"you assumed"},{"c":"بِرَبِّكُمْ","d":"birabbikum","e":"about your Lord"},{"c":"أَرْدَاكُمْ","d":"ardākum","e":"It has ruined you"},{"c":"فَأَصْبَحْتُمْ","d":"fa-aṣbaḥtum","e":"and you have become"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْخَاسِرِينَ","d":"l-khāsirīna","e":"the losers"}],"a":{"g":"And that was your assumption which you assumed about your Lord. It has brought you to ruin, and you have become among the losers.\""}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنْ","d":"fa-in","e":"Then if"},{"c":"يَصْبِرُوا","d":"yaṣbirū","e":"they endure"},{"c":"فَالنَّارُ","d":"fal-nāru","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"مَثْوًى","d":"mathwan","e":"(is) an abode"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"and if"},{"c":"يَسْتَعْتِبُوا","d":"yastaʿtibū","e":"they ask for favor"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"then not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"(will be) of"},{"c":"الْمُعْتَبِينَ","d":"l-muʿ'tabīna","e":"those who receive favor"}],"a":{"g":"So [even] if they are patient, the Fire is a residence for them; and if they ask to appease [Allah], they will not be of those who are allowed to appease."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَيَّضْنَا","d":"waqayyaḍnā","e":"And We have destined"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"قُرَنَاءَ","d":"quranāa","e":"companions"},{"c":"فَزَيَّنُوا","d":"fazayyanū","e":"(who) made fair-seeming"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"بَيْنَ","d":"bayna","e":"(was) before them"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"(was) before them"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"خَلْفَهُمْ","d":"khalfahum","e":"(was) behind them"},{"c":"وَحَقَّ","d":"waḥaqqa","e":"and (is) justified"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمُ","d":"ʿalayhimu","e":"against them"},{"c":"الْقَوْلُ","d":"l-qawlu","e":"the Word"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"among"},{"c":"أُمَمٍ","d":"umamin","e":"nations"},{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"(that have) passed away"},{"c":"خَلَتْ","d":"khalat","e":"(that have) passed away"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَبْلِهِمْ","d":"qablihim","e":"before them"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْجِنِّ","d":"l-jini","e":"the jinn"},{"c":"وَالْإِنْسِ","d":"wal-insi","e":"and the men"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"Indeed, they"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"were"},{"c":"خَاسِرِينَ","d":"khāsirīna","e":"losers"}],"a":{"g":"And We appointed for them companions who made attractive to them what was before them and what was behind them [of sin], and the word has come into effect upon them among nations which had passed on before them of jinn and men. Indeed, they [all] were losers."}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"And said"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَسْمَعُوا","d":"tasmaʿū","e":"listen"},{"c":"لِهَذَا","d":"lihādhā","e":"to this"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانِ","d":"l-qur'āni","e":"Quran"},{"c":"وَالْغَوْا","d":"wal-ghaw","e":"and make noise"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therein"},{"c":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","d":"laʿallakum","e":"that you may"},{"c":"تَغْلِبُونَ","d":"taghlibūna","e":"overcome"}],"a":{"g":"And those who disbelieve say, \"Do not listen to this Qur'an and speak noisily during [the recitation of] it that perhaps you will overcome.\""}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَنُذِيقَنَّ","d":"falanudhīqanna","e":"But surely We will cause to taste"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"عَذَابًا","d":"ʿadhāban","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"شَدِيدًا","d":"shadīdan","e":"severe"},{"c":"وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّهُمْ","d":"walanajziyannahum","e":"and surely We will recompense them"},{"c":"أَسْوَأَ","d":"aswa-a","e":"(the) worst"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(of) what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَعْمَلُونَ","d":"yaʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"But We will surely cause those who disbelieve to taste a severe punishment, and We will surely recompense them for the worst of what they had been doing."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"جَزَاءُ","d":"jazāu","e":"(is the) recompense"},{"c":"أَعْدَاءِ","d":"aʿdāi","e":"(of the) enemies"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"النَّارُ","d":"l-nāru","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"دَارُ","d":"dāru","e":"(is the) home"},{"c":"الْخُلْدِ","d":"l-khul'di","e":"(of) the eternity"},{"c":"جَزَاءً","d":"jazāan","e":"(as) recompense"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"of Our Verses"},{"c":"يَجْحَدُونَ","d":"yajḥadūna","e":"reject"}],"a":{"g":"That is the recompense of the enemies of Allah - the Fire. For them therein is the home of eternity as recompense for what they, of Our verses, were rejecting."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"And (will) say"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"رَبَّنَا","d":"rabbanā","e":"Our Lord!"},{"c":"أَرِنَا","d":"arinā","e":"Show us"},{"c":"الَّذَيْنِ","d":"alladhayni","e":"those who"},{"c":"أَضَلَّانَا","d":"aḍallānā","e":"misled us"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْجِنِّ","d":"l-jini","e":"the jinn"},{"c":"وَالْإِنْسِ","d":"wal-insi","e":"and the men"},{"c":"نَجْعَلْهُمَا","d":"najʿalhumā","e":"(so) we may put them"},{"c":"تَحْتَ","d":"taḥta","e":"under"},{"c":"أَقْدَامِنَا","d":"aqdāminā","e":"our feet"},{"c":"لِيَكُونَا","d":"liyakūnā","e":"that they be"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْأَسْفَلِينَ","d":"l-asfalīna","e":"the lowest"}],"a":{"g":"And those who disbelieved will [then] say, \"Our Lord, show us those who misled us of the jinn and men [so] we may put them under our feet that they will be among the lowest.\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"say"},{"c":"رَبُّنَا","d":"rabbunā","e":"Our Lord"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"(is) Allah"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"اسْتَقَامُوا","d":"is'taqāmū","e":"stand firm"},{"c":"تَتَنَزَّلُ","d":"tatanazzalu","e":"will descend"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمُ","d":"ʿalayhimu","e":"on them"},{"c":"الْمَلَائِكَةُ","d":"l-malāikatu","e":"the Angels"},{"c":"أَلَّا","d":"allā","e":"Do not"},{"c":"تَخَافُوا","d":"takhāfū","e":"fear"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and (do) not"},{"c":"تَحْزَنُوا","d":"taḥzanū","e":"grieve"},{"c":"وَأَبْشِرُوا","d":"wa-abshirū","e":"but receive the glad tidings"},{"c":"بِالْجَنَّةِ","d":"bil-janati","e":"of Paradise"},{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"which"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you were"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"promised"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who have said, \"Our Lord is Allah \" and then remained on a right course - the angels will descend upon them, [saying], \"Do not fear and do not grieve but receive good tidings of Paradise, which you were promised."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"أَوْلِيَاؤُكُمْ","d":"awliyāukum","e":"(are) your protectors"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْحَيَوةِ","d":"l-ḥayati","e":"the life"},{"c":"الدُّنْيَا","d":"l-dun'yā","e":"(of) the world"},{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"and in"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرَةِ","d":"l-ākhirati","e":"the Hereafter"},{"c":"وَلَكُمْ","d":"walakum","e":"And for you"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"whatever"},{"c":"تَشْتَهِي","d":"tashtahī","e":"desire"},{"c":"أَنْفُسُكُمْ","d":"anfusukum","e":"your souls"},{"c":"وَلَكُمْ","d":"walakum","e":"and for you"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تَدَّعُونَ","d":"taddaʿūna","e":"you ask"}],"a":{"g":"We [angels] were your allies in worldly life and [are so] in the Hereafter. And you will have therein whatever your souls desire, and you will have therein whatever you request [or wish]"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"نُزُلًا","d":"nuzulan","e":"A hospitable gift"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"غَفُورٍ","d":"ghafūrin","e":"(the) Oft-Forgiving"},{"c":"رَحِيمٍ","d":"raḥīmin","e":"(the) Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"As accommodation from a [Lord who is] Forgiving and Merciful.\""}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And who"},{"c":"أَحْسَنُ","d":"aḥsanu","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"قَوْلًا","d":"qawlan","e":"(in) speech"},{"c":"مِمَّنْ","d":"mimman","e":"than (one) who"},{"c":"دَعَا","d":"daʿā","e":"invites"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَعَمِلَ","d":"waʿamila","e":"and does"},{"c":"صَالِحًا","d":"ṣāliḥan","e":"righteous (deeds)"},{"c":"وَقَالَ","d":"waqāla","e":"and says"},{"c":"إِنَّنِي","d":"innanī","e":"Indeed I am"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْمُسْلِمِينَ","d":"l-mus'limīna","e":"those who submit"}],"a":{"g":"And who is better in speech than one who invites to Allah and does righteousness and says, \"Indeed, I am of the Muslims.\""}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَسْتَوِي","d":"tastawī","e":"are equal"},{"c":"الْحَسَنَةُ","d":"l-ḥasanatu","e":"the good (deed)"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and"},{"c":"السَّيِّئَةُ","d":"l-sayi-atu","e":"the evil (deed)"},{"c":"ادْفَعْ","d":"id'faʿ","e":"Repel"},{"c":"بِالَّتِي","d":"bi-allatī","e":"by (that) which"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"[it]"},{"c":"أَحْسَنُ","d":"aḥsanu","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"then behold!"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"One who"},{"c":"بَيْنَكَ","d":"baynaka","e":"between you"},{"c":"وَبَيْنَهُ","d":"wabaynahu","e":"and between him"},{"c":"عَدَاوَةٌ","d":"ʿadāwatun","e":"(was) enmity"},{"c":"كَأَنَّهُ","d":"ka-annahu","e":"as if he"},{"c":"وَلِيٌّ","d":"waliyyun","e":"(was) a friend"},{"c":"حَمِيمٌ","d":"ḥamīmun","e":"intimate"}],"a":{"g":"And not equal are the good deed and the bad. Repel [evil] by that [deed] which is better; and thereupon the one whom between you and him is enmity [will become] as though he was a devoted friend."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يُلَقَّاهَا","d":"yulaqqāhā","e":"it is granted"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(to) those who"},{"c":"صَبَرُوا","d":"ṣabarū","e":"(are) patient"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يُلَقَّاهَا","d":"yulaqqāhā","e":"it is granted"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"ذُو","d":"dhū","e":"(to the) owner"},{"c":"حَظٍّ","d":"ḥaẓẓin","e":"(of) fortune"},{"c":"عَظِيمٍ","d":"ʿaẓīmin","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"But none is granted it except those who are patient, and none is granted it except one having a great portion [of good]."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِمَّا","d":"wa-immā","e":"And if"},{"c":"يَنْزَغَنَّكَ","d":"yanzaghannaka","e":"whisper comes to you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الشَّيْطَانِ","d":"l-shayṭāni","e":"the Shaitan"},{"c":"نَزْغٌ","d":"nazghun","e":"an evil suggestion"},{"c":"فَاسْتَعِذْ","d":"fa-is'taʿidh","e":"then seek refuge"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"in Allah"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"[He]"},{"c":"السَّمِيعُ","d":"l-samīʿu","e":"(is) the All-Hearer"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمُ","d":"l-ʿalīmu","e":"the All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"And if there comes to you from Satan an evil suggestion, then seek refuge in Allah. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And of"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"اللَّيْلُ","d":"al-laylu","e":"(are) the night"},{"c":"وَالنَّهَارُ","d":"wal-nahāru","e":"and the day"},{"c":"وَالشَّمْسُ","d":"wal-shamsu","e":"and the sun"},{"c":"وَالْقَمَرُ","d":"wal-qamaru","e":"and the moon"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Do) not"},{"c":"تَسْجُدُوا","d":"tasjudū","e":"prostrate"},{"c":"لِلشَّمْسِ","d":"lilshamsi","e":"to the sun"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"لِلْقَمَرِ","d":"lil'qamari","e":"to the moon"},{"c":"وَاسْجُدُوا","d":"wa-us'judū","e":"but prostrate"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"to Allah"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَهُنَّ","d":"khalaqahunna","e":"created them"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you"},{"c":"إِيَّاهُ","d":"iyyāhu","e":"Him alone"},{"c":"تَعْبُدُونَ","d":"taʿbudūna","e":"worship"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs are the night and day and the sun and moon. Do not prostrate to the sun or to the moon, but prostate to Allah, who created them, if it should be Him that you worship."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنِ","d":"fa-ini","e":"But if"},{"c":"اسْتَكْبَرُوا","d":"is'takbarū","e":"they are arrogant"},{"c":"فَالَّذِينَ","d":"fa-alladhīna","e":"then those who"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"(are) near"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"يُسَبِّحُونَ","d":"yusabbiḥūna","e":"glorify"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"Him"},{"c":"بِاللَّيْلِ","d":"bi-al-layli","e":"by night"},{"c":"وَالنَّهَارِ","d":"wal-nahāri","e":"and day"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"And they"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَسْءَمُونَ","d":"yasamūna","e":"tire"}],"a":{"g":"But if they are arrogant - then those who are near your Lord exalt Him by night and by day, and they do not become weary."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"And among"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Signs"},{"c":"أَنَّكَ","d":"annaka","e":"(is) that you"},{"c":"تَرَى","d":"tarā","e":"see"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"خَاشِعَةً","d":"khāshiʿatan","e":"barren"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"but when"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَا","d":"anzalnā","e":"We send down"},{"c":"عَلَيْهَا","d":"ʿalayhā","e":"upon it"},{"c":"الْمَاءَ","d":"l-māa","e":"water"},{"c":"اهْتَزَّتْ","d":"ih'tazzat","e":"it is stirred (to life)"},{"c":"وَرَبَتْ","d":"warabat","e":"and grows"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the One Who"},{"c":"أَحْيَاهَا","d":"aḥyāhā","e":"gives it life"},{"c":"لَمُحْيِي","d":"lamuḥ'yī","e":"(is) surely the Giver of life"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَى","d":"l-mawtā","e":"(to) the dead"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) on"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"قَدِيرٌ","d":"qadīrun","e":"All-Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"And of His signs is that you see the earth stilled, but when We send down upon it rain, it quivers and grows. Indeed, He who has given it life is the Giver of Life to the dead. Indeed, He is over all things competent."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"يُلْحِدُونَ","d":"yul'ḥidūna","e":"distort"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"[in]"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِنَا","d":"āyātinā","e":"Our Verses"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(are) not"},{"c":"يَخْفَوْنَ","d":"yakhfawna","e":"hidden"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"from Us"},{"c":"أَفَمَنْ","d":"afaman","e":"So is (he) who"},{"c":"يُلْقَى","d":"yul'qā","e":"is cast"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"better"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(he) who"},{"c":"يَأْتِي","d":"yatī","e":"comes"},{"c":"ءَامِنًا","d":"āminan","e":"secure"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(on the) Day"},{"c":"الْقِيَامَةِ","d":"l-qiyāmati","e":"(of) Resurrection"},{"c":"اعْمَلُوا","d":"iʿ'malū","e":"Do"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"شِئْتُمْ","d":"shi'tum","e":"you will"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed He"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"you do"},{"c":"بَصِيرٌ","d":"baṣīrun","e":"(is) All-Seer"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who inject deviation into Our verses are not concealed from Us. So, is he who is cast into the Fire better or he who comes secure on the Day of Resurrection? Do whatever you will; indeed, He is Seeing of what you do."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"بِالذِّكْرِ","d":"bil-dhik'ri","e":"in the Reminder"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"when"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"it comes to them"},{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed it"},{"c":"لَكِتَابٌ","d":"lakitābun","e":"(is) surely a Book"},{"c":"عَزِيزٌ","d":"ʿazīzun","e":"mighty"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, those who disbelieve in the message after it has come to them... And indeed, it is a mighty Book."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَأْتِيهِ","d":"yatīhi","e":"comes to it"},{"c":"الْبَاطِلُ","d":"l-bāṭilu","e":"the falsehood"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"بَيْنِ","d":"bayni","e":"before it"},{"c":"يَدَيْهِ","d":"yadayhi","e":"before it"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"خَلْفِهِ","d":"khalfihi","e":"behind it"},{"c":"تَنْزِيلٌ","d":"tanzīlun","e":"A Revelation"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"حَكِيمٍ","d":"ḥakīmin","e":"(the) All-Wise"},{"c":"حَمِيدٍ","d":"ḥamīdin","e":"(the) Praiseworthy"}],"a":{"g":"Falsehood cannot approach it from before it or from behind it; [it is] a revelation from a [Lord who is] Wise and Praiseworthy."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يُقَالُ","d":"yuqālu","e":"is said"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"to you"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"was said"},{"c":"قِيلَ","d":"qīla","e":"was said"},{"c":"لِلرُّسُلِ","d":"lilrrusuli","e":"to the Messengers"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before you"},{"c":"قَبْلِكَ","d":"qablika","e":"before you"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"لَذُو","d":"ladhū","e":"(is) Possessor"},{"c":"مَغْفِرَةٍ","d":"maghfiratin","e":"(of) forgiveness"},{"c":"وَذُو","d":"wadhū","e":"and Possessor"},{"c":"عِقَابٍ","d":"ʿiqābin","e":"(of) penalty"},{"c":"أَلِيمٍ","d":"alīmin","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"Nothing is said to you, [O Muhammad], except what was already said to the messengers before you. Indeed, your Lord is a possessor of forgiveness and a possessor of painful penalty."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"And if"},{"c":"جَعَلْنَاهُ","d":"jaʿalnāhu","e":"We (had) made it"},{"c":"قُرْءَانًا","d":"qur'ānan","e":"a Quran"},{"c":"أَعْجَمِيًّا","d":"aʿjamiyyan","e":"(in) a foreign (language)"},{"c":"لَقَالُوا","d":"laqālū","e":"they (would have) said"},{"c":"لَوْلَا","d":"lawlā","e":"Why not"},{"c":"فُصِّلَتْ","d":"fuṣṣilat","e":"are explained in detail"},{"c":"ءَايَاتُهُ","d":"āyātuhu","e":"its verses"},{"c":"ءَأَعْجَمِيٌّ","d":"āʿ'jamiyyun","e":"(Is it) a foreign (language)"},{"c":"وَعَرَبِيٌّ","d":"waʿarabiyyun","e":"and an Arab"},{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"It (is)"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"for those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"هُدًى","d":"hudan","e":"a guidance"},{"c":"وَشِفَاءٌ","d":"washifāon","e":"and a healing"},{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"And those who"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"believe"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ءَاذَانِهِمْ","d":"ādhānihim","e":"their ears"},{"c":"وَقْرٌ","d":"waqrun","e":"(is) deafness"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and it"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"(is) for them"},{"c":"عَمًى","d":"ʿaman","e":"blindness"},{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"Those"},{"c":"يُنَادَوْنَ","d":"yunādawna","e":"are being called"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَكَانٍ","d":"makānin","e":"a place"},{"c":"بَعِيدٍ","d":"baʿīdin","e":"far"}],"a":{"g":"And if We had made it a non-Arabic Qur'an, they would have said, \"Why are its verses not explained in detail [in our language]? Is it a foreign [recitation] and an Arab [messenger]?\" Say, \"It is, for those who believe, a guidance and cure.\" And those who do not believe - in their ears is deafness, and it is upon them blindness. Those are being called from a distant place."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"ءَاتَيْنَا","d":"ātaynā","e":"We gave"},{"c":"مُوسَى","d":"mūsā","e":"Musa"},{"c":"الْكِتَابَ","d":"l-kitāba","e":"the Book"},{"c":"فَاخْتُلِفَ","d":"fa-ukh'tulifa","e":"but disputes arose"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَلَوْلَا","d":"walawlā","e":"And had it not been"},{"c":"كَلِمَةٌ","d":"kalimatun","e":"(for) a word"},{"c":"سَبَقَتْ","d":"sabaqat","e":"that preceded"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"لَقُضِيَ","d":"laquḍiya","e":"surely would have been settled"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمْ","d":"baynahum","e":"between them"},{"c":"وَإِنَّهُمْ","d":"wa-innahum","e":"But indeed they"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"surely (are) in"},{"c":"شَكٍّ","d":"shakkin","e":"doubt"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"about it"},{"c":"مُرِيبٍ","d":"murībin","e":"disquieting"}],"a":{"g":"And We had already given Moses the Scripture, but it came under disagreement. And if not for a word that preceded from your Lord, it would have been concluded between them. And indeed they are, concerning the Qur'an, in disquieting doubt."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Whoever"},{"c":"عَمِلَ","d":"ʿamila","e":"does"},{"c":"صَالِحًا","d":"ṣāliḥan","e":"righteous deeds"},{"c":"فَلِنَفْسِهِ","d":"falinafsihi","e":"then it is for his soul"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"and whoever"},{"c":"أَسَاءَ","d":"asāa","e":"does evil"},{"c":"فَعَلَيْهَا","d":"faʿalayhā","e":"then it is against it"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"رَبُّكَ","d":"rabbuka","e":"(is) your Lord"},{"c":"بِظَلَّامٍ","d":"biẓallāmin","e":"unjust"},{"c":"لِلْعَبِيدِ","d":"lil'ʿabīdi","e":"to His slaves"}],"a":{"g":"Whoever does righteousness - it is for his [own] soul; and whoever does evil [does so] against it. And your Lord is not ever unjust to [His] servants."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"To Him"},{"c":"يُرَدُّ","d":"yuraddu","e":"is referred"},{"c":"عِلْمُ","d":"ʿil'mu","e":"(the) knowledge"},{"c":"السَّاعَةِ","d":"l-sāʿati","e":"(of) the Hour"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَخْرُجُ","d":"takhruju","e":"comes out"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"ثَمَرَاتٍ","d":"thamarātin","e":"fruits"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"أَكْمَامِهَا","d":"akmāmihā","e":"their coverings"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"تَحْمِلُ","d":"taḥmilu","e":"bears"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"أُنْثَى","d":"unthā","e":"female"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"تَضَعُ","d":"taḍaʿu","e":"gives birth"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِعِلْمِهِ","d":"biʿil'mihi","e":"with His knowledge"},{"c":"وَيَوْمَ","d":"wayawma","e":"And (the) Day"},{"c":"يُنَادِيهِمْ","d":"yunādīhim","e":"He will call them"},{"c":"أَيْنَ","d":"ayna","e":"Where (are)"},{"c":"شُرَكَاءِي","d":"shurakāī","e":"My partners"},{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They will say"},{"c":"ءَاذَنَّاكَ","d":"ādhannāka","e":"We announce (to) You"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"among us"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شَهِيدٍ","d":"shahīdin","e":"witness"}],"a":{"g":"To him [alone] is attributed knowledge of the Hour. And fruits emerge not from their coverings nor does a female conceive or give birth except with His knowledge. And the Day He will call to them, \"Where are My 'partners'?\" they will say, \"We announce to You that there is [no longer] among us any witness [to that].\""}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَضَلَّ","d":"waḍalla","e":"And lost"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"from them"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"يَدْعُونَ","d":"yadʿūna","e":"invoking"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"وَظَنُّوا","d":"waẓannū","e":"and they (will) be certain"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(that) not"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مَحِيصٍ","d":"maḥīṣin","e":"place of escape"}],"a":{"g":"And lost from them will be those they were invoking before, and they will be certain that they have no place of escape."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(Does) not"},{"c":"يَسْءَمُ","d":"yasamu","e":"get tired"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"man"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"دُعَاءِ","d":"duʿāi","e":"praying"},{"c":"الْخَيْرِ","d":"l-khayri","e":"(for) the good"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"but if"},{"c":"مَسَّهُ","d":"massahu","e":"touches him"},{"c":"الشَّرُّ","d":"l-sharu","e":"the evil"},{"c":"فَيَئُوسٌ","d":"fayaūsun","e":"then he gives up hope"},{"c":"قَنُوطٌ","d":"qanūṭun","e":"(and) despairs"}],"a":{"g":"Man is not weary of supplication for good [things], but if evil touches him, he is hopeless and despairing."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَئِنْ","d":"wala-in","e":"And verily, if"},{"c":"أَذَقْنَاهُ","d":"adhaqnāhu","e":"We let him taste"},{"c":"رَحْمَةً","d":"raḥmatan","e":"mercy"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"from Us"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after"},{"c":"بَعْدِ","d":"baʿdi","e":"after"},{"c":"ضَرَّاءَ","d":"ḍarrāa","e":"an adversity"},{"c":"مَسَّتْهُ","d":"massathu","e":"(has) touched him"},{"c":"لَيَقُولَنَّ","d":"layaqūlanna","e":"he will surely say"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This (is)"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"(due) to me"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَظُنُّ","d":"aẓunnu","e":"I think"},{"c":"السَّاعَةَ","d":"l-sāʿata","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"قَائِمَةً","d":"qāimatan","e":"(will be) established"},{"c":"وَلَئِنْ","d":"wala-in","e":"and if"},{"c":"رُجِعْتُ","d":"rujiʿ'tu","e":"I am returned"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"my Lord"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"indeed"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"for me"},{"c":"عِنْدَهُ","d":"ʿindahu","e":"with Him"},{"c":"لَلْحُسْنَى","d":"lalḥus'nā","e":"(will be) the best"},{"c":"فَلَنُنَبِّئَنَّ","d":"falanunabbi-anna","e":"But We will surely inform"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"about what"},{"c":"عَمِلُوا","d":"ʿamilū","e":"they did"},{"c":"وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُمْ","d":"walanudhīqannahum","e":"and We will surely make them taste"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"عَذَابٍ","d":"ʿadhābin","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"غَلِيظٍ","d":"ghalīẓin","e":"severe"}],"a":{"g":"And if We let him taste mercy from Us after an adversity which has touched him, he will surely say, \"This is [due] to me, and I do not think the Hour will occur; and [even] if I should be returned to my Lord, indeed, for me there will be with Him the best.\" But We will surely inform those who disbelieved about what they did, and We will surely make them taste a massive punishment."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"أَنْعَمْنَا","d":"anʿamnā","e":"We bestow favor"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانِ","d":"l-insāni","e":"man"},{"c":"أَعْرَضَ","d":"aʿraḍa","e":"he turns away"},{"c":"وَنَءَا","d":"wanaā","e":"and distances himself"},{"c":"بِجَانِبِهِ","d":"bijānibihi","e":"and distances himself"},{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"but when"},{"c":"مَسَّهُ","d":"massahu","e":"touches him"},{"c":"الشَّرُّ","d":"l-sharu","e":"the evil"},{"c":"فَذُو","d":"fadhū","e":"then (he is) full"},{"c":"دُعَاءٍ","d":"duʿāin","e":"(of) supplication"},{"c":"عَرِيضٍ","d":"ʿarīḍin","e":"lengthy"}],"a":{"g":"And when We bestow favor upon man, he turns away and distances himself; but when evil touches him, then he is full of extensive supplication."}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","d":"ara-aytum","e":"You see"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"it is"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"عِنْدِ","d":"ʿindi","e":"from"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"كَفَرْتُمْ","d":"kafartum","e":"you disbelieve"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"in it"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"who"},{"c":"أَضَلُّ","d":"aḍallu","e":"(is) more astray"},{"c":"مِمَّنْ","d":"mimman","e":"than (one) who"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"he"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"شِقَاقٍ","d":"shiqāqin","e":"opposition"},{"c":"بَعِيدٍ","d":"baʿīdin","e":"far"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Have you considered: if the Qur'an is from Allah and you disbelieved in it, who would be more astray than one who is in extreme dissension?\""}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"سَنُرِيهِمْ","d":"sanurīhim","e":"Soon We will show them"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِنَا","d":"āyātinā","e":"Our Signs"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْءَافَاقِ","d":"l-āfāqi","e":"the horizons"},{"c":"وَفِي","d":"wafī","e":"and in"},{"c":"أَنْفُسِهِمْ","d":"anfusihim","e":"themselves"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"until"},{"c":"يَتَبَيَّنَ","d":"yatabayyana","e":"becomes clear"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"أَنَّهُ","d":"annahu","e":"that it"},{"c":"الْحَقُّ","d":"l-ḥaqu","e":"(is) the truth"},{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Is (it) not"},{"c":"يَكْفِ","d":"yakfi","e":"sufficient"},{"c":"بِرَبِّكَ","d":"birabbika","e":"concerning your Lord"},{"c":"أَنَّهُ","d":"annahu","e":"that He"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) over"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"all"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"things"},{"c":"شَهِيدٌ","d":"shahīdun","e":"a Witness"}],"a":{"g":"We will show them Our signs in the horizons and within themselves until it becomes clear to them that it is the truth. But is it not sufficient concerning your Lord that He is, over all things, a Witness?"}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَا","d":"alā","e":"Unquestionably"},{"c":"إِنَّهُمْ","d":"innahum","e":"they"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"مِرْيَةٍ","d":"mir'yatin","e":"doubt"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"about"},{"c":"لِقَاءِ","d":"liqāi","e":"(the) meeting"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(with) their Lord"},{"c":"أَلَا","d":"alā","e":"Unquestionably"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"indeed He"},{"c":"بِكُلِّ","d":"bikulli","e":"(is) of all"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"things"},{"c":"مُحِيطٌ","d":"muḥīṭun","e":"encompassing"}],"a":{"g":"Unquestionably, they are in doubt about the meeting with their Lord. Unquestionably He is, of all things, encompassing."}}}